(7012571, 1061223, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats, that tree reflection is amazing. So this is what a Centaur looks like when the horse side leaves. You have a masterpiece here, please sell prints.</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats, that tree reflection is amazing. So this is what a Centaur looks like when the horse side leaves. You have a masterpiece here, please sell prints.', '2013-04-03 03:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012576, 1061240, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2, really only one masterpiece beats this, and not by much. Your lighting is perfect, almost an x-ray effect. But it''s the best female entry in this challenge. This is the first time in almost 80,000 votes that I''ve award 2 10''s in the same challenge, you''re one of them. Congrats on being the other masterpiece.</td>', 'Top 2, really only one masterpiece beats this, and not by much. Your lighting is perfect, almost an x-ray effect. But it''s the best female entry in this challenge. This is the first time in almost 80,000 votes that I''ve award 2 10''s in the same challenge, you''re one of them. Congrats on being the other masterpiece.', '2013-04-03 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012577, 1062145, 16046, '<td valign="top">top 3, now that''s the way to look into a camera</td>', 'top 3, now that''s the way to look into a camera', '2013-04-03 03:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012578, 1061342, 16046, '<td valign="top">Front page stuff</td>', 'Front page stuff', '2013-04-03 03:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012587, 1061223, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying the slight mania communicated in this image John.<br/> <br/>Compositionally - stunning.<br/> <br/>Physique - just stop it. You''re making the rest of us look bad. Go and have a burger, some fries (lots) and a few sherry trifles!</td>', 'I''m enjoying the slight mania communicated in this image John. Compositionally - stunning. Physique - just stop it. You''re making the rest of us look bad. Go and have a burger, some fries (lots) and a few sherry trifles!', '2013-04-03 04:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012590, 1062037, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is just spectacular. Such ambiguity.</td>', 'This is just spectacular. Such ambiguity.', '2013-04-03 04:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012592, 1061368, 113156, '<td valign="top">She''s going to have to go back up one day, stunningly insular.</td>', 'She''s going to have to go back up one day, stunningly insular.', '2013-04-03 04:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012593, 1062060, 113156, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the bunch, emotion, processing, all work wonders here.</td>', 'My favorite of the bunch, emotion, processing, all work wonders here.', '2013-04-03 04:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012595, 1062034, 49109, '<td valign="top">Had to look hard to find something wrong in this image; the only (minor) flaws are the missing catchlights in the eyes and some dirt on the floor. 9 and my pick for the blue.</td>', 'Had to look hard to find something wrong in this image; the only (minor) flaws are the missing catchlights in the eyes and some dirt on the floor. 9 and my pick for the blue.', '2013-04-03 04:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012596, 1062145, 49109, '<td valign="top">This must be Paul''s work. Overall very well done, the cat''s looks are priceless (WTF does she see?); pose and looks of the model are great. The blown lights on her leg distract a bit, and I wonder why you placed the chair in front of the couch (or haven''t moved the couch out of the scene, if you wanted that specific lighting situation). My pick for the red (how fitting).</td>', 'This must be Paul''s work. Overall very well done, the cat''s looks are priceless (WTF does she see?); pose and looks of the model are great. The blown lights on her leg distract a bit, and I wonder why you placed the chair in front of the couch (or haven''t moved the couch out of the scene, if you wanted that specific lighting situation). My pick for the red (how fitting).', '2013-04-03 04:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012598, 1061355, 49109, '<td valign="top">A tad bit heavy on the processing, otherwise very well done.</td>', 'A tad bit heavy on the processing, otherwise very well done.', '2013-04-03 04:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012601, 1061223, 49109, '<td valign="top">Clever. And well processed as usual.</td>', 'Clever. And well processed as usual.', '2013-04-03 04:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012605, 1062167, 98775, '<td valign="top">I love the way you treated your subject, but the use of blurring effects made it a bit <i></i>too<i></i> dreamy for me. Great shot.</td>', 'I love the way you treated your subject, but the use of blurring effects made it a bit too dreamy for me. Great shot.', '2013-04-03 04:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012606, 1062060, 98775, '<td valign="top">The composition makes this shot tell a story- like they are ready to walk out and start their week fresh, r life, for that matter, but are just not yet comfortable stepping into full view, into the light. I love this shot.</td>', 'The composition makes this shot tell a story- like they are ready to walk out and start their week fresh, r life, for that matter, but are just not yet comfortable stepping into full view, into the light. I love this shot.', '2013-04-03 04:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012608, 1062057, 98775, '<td valign="top">My love of tattoos makes me kind of biased on this, but I like the way you treated your model. the only thing that really detracts from this is her... glasses? I can''t tell if she is wearing glass or if her ear caught some uneven light. I think it is an ear now that i look at it...maybe moving that one strand of hair out of the way may have helped? it is a beautiful shot, but that one little bit is distracting. I like, also, that you left some imperfections on her skin. She really is "exposed" that way. 8</td>', 'My love of tattoos makes me kind of biased on this, but I like the way you treated your model. the only thing that really detracts from this is her... glasses? I can''t tell if she is wearing glass or if her ear caught some uneven light. I think it is an ear now that i look at it...maybe moving that one strand of hair out of the way may have helped? it is a beautiful shot, but that one little bit is distracting. I like, also, that you left some imperfections on her skin. She really is "exposed" that way. 8', '2013-04-03 04:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012609, 1062124, 98775, '<td valign="top">Unique subject matter, and it certainly is raw. I like it when nude photography tells the truth as well as looks amazing.  The angle just puts the viewer at waist level. Not where I want to be, you know? Still very well done and above average.</td>', 'Unique subject matter, and it certainly is raw. I like it when nude photography tells the truth as well as looks amazing.  The angle just puts the viewer at waist level. Not where I want to be, you know? Still very well done and above average.', '2013-04-03 04:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012610, 1062111, 98775, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this was intentional, but framing the voyeur just behind the corner makes his appreciation of art into a shameful obsession. It fits the title perfectly. well composed, too. I really like photos that tell a little bit more about what is happening rather than just capturing a split second.</td>', 'Not sure if this was intentional, but framing the voyeur just behind the corner makes his appreciation of art into a shameful obsession. It fits the title perfectly. well composed, too. I really like photos that tell a little bit more about what is happening rather than just capturing a split second.', '2013-04-03 04:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012611, 1062059, 98775, '<td valign="top">I have a Pit-mix puppy that does the same stuff. I''m partial to the subject matter so I, of course, love this picture. Also, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I have a Pit-mix puppy that does the same stuff. I''m partial to the subject matter so I, of course, love this picture. Also, it''s a great shot.', '2013-04-03 04:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012613, 1062148, 98775, '<td valign="top">This image is just haunting enough to keep me looking, studying it. I imagine that the reflection to the left is your light source, but it almost looks like a burning effigy. If a photo makes me wonder "what is happening?" I already am more interested in it than most composed shots out there. Well done.</td>', 'This image is just haunting enough to keep me looking, studying it. I imagine that the reflection to the left is your light source, but it almost looks like a burning effigy. If a photo makes me wonder "what is happening?" I already am more interested in it than most composed shots out there. Well done.', '2013-04-03 04:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012614, 1062108, 98775, '<td valign="top">Nude photography that is also natural. I really like this shot.</td>', 'Nude photography that is also natural. I really like this shot.', '2013-04-03 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012615, 1062145, 98775, '<td valign="top">Tattoos, red hair, and a cat that is just as awed as I am. Fantastic.</td>', 'Tattoos, red hair, and a cat that is just as awed as I am. Fantastic.', '2013-04-03 05:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012616, 1061768, 98775, '<td valign="top">I love that your model is fit and has muscle tone and looks like a normal woman, but there is too much uncertainty about her face and hair. Was she not comfortable having her picture taken nude?</td>', 'I love that your model is fit and has muscle tone and looks like a normal woman, but there is too much uncertainty about her face and hair. Was she not comfortable having her picture taken nude?', '2013-04-03 05:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012617, 1062130, 98775, '<td valign="top">I always say that I love photos that tell a story! This one certainly makes me wonder how far this gentleman can swim. The only thing I find lacking is some drama with the composition. A lower angle and some deep footprints wandering into the surf would have added some drama to this, but you still get tons of respect for making a photograph tell more than just a split-second''s story.</td>', 'I always say that I love photos that tell a story! This one certainly makes me wonder how far this gentleman can swim. The only thing I find lacking is some drama with the composition. A lower angle and some deep footprints wandering into the surf would have added some drama to this, but you still get tons of respect for making a photograph tell more than just a split-second''s story.', '2013-04-03 05:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012618, 1061342, 98775, '<td valign="top">This looks like an advertisement for skin cream. It makes me want to see her whole body, like there isn''t enough here to appreciate her entirely.</td>', 'This looks like an advertisement for skin cream. It makes me want to see her whole body, like there isn''t enough here to appreciate her entirely.', '2013-04-03 05:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7012619, 1062101, 98775, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on here! Took me a second, but the mirrored table really makes this into a piece where you spend your fist few seconds question ing if the whole thing isn''t a painting. Not what I think when I think nude photography, but I really, really enjoyed this one.</td>', 'There is a lot going on here! Took me a second, but the mirrored table really makes this into a piece where you spend your fist few seconds question ing if the whole thing isn''t a painting. Not what I think when I think nude photography, but I really, really enjoyed this one.', '2013-04-03 05:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
