(7015101, 1062124, 6519, '<td valign="top">Ok, I need to let you know that I am giving you a 5 for this NOT because I have a problem with hairy men, but because I just don''t think it is a very successful/compelling photograph.</td>', 'Ok, I need to let you know that I am giving you a 5 for this NOT because I have a problem with hairy men, but because I just don''t think it is a very successful/compelling photograph.', '2013-04-07 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
