(7015122, 1062145, 69368, '<td valign="top">love the cat :-)</td>', 'love the cat :-)', '2013-04-07 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015125, 1062145, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well executed shot. I really like the woman/cat combo. I like the light in the background too.<br/> <br/>The blown foot and the thing behind the sofa are a little distracting though. Nonetheless, it''s a high score from me.</td>', 'Very well executed shot. I really like the woman/cat combo. I like the light in the background too. The blown foot and the thing behind the sofa are a little distracting though. Nonetheless, it''s a high score from me.', '2013-04-07 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015127, 1061355, 100393, '<td valign="top">Superbly executed image - great light and texture. A high score from me but there are few with a greater sense of mystery/story that I prefer in this challenge.</td>', 'Superbly executed image - great light and texture. A high score from me but there are few with a greater sense of mystery/story that I prefer in this challenge.', '2013-04-07 08:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015129, 1062167, 100393, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft rendition. Beautiful light too. Intimate but still private. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely soft rendition. Beautiful light too. Intimate but still private. Well done.', '2013-04-07 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015138, 1062207, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great classical pose, pretty well-lit too.<br/> <br/>I wonder about the colour of the toning though - I think a warmer tone may have been better.<br/> <br/>The composition is slightly eclectic - given we have her back, I''d have framed the image so that she sits on the right (not left) edge of the frame.<br/> <br/>A 7 from me though.</td>', 'Great classical pose, pretty well-lit too. I wonder about the colour of the toning though - I think a warmer tone may have been better. The composition is slightly eclectic - given we have her back, I''d have framed the image so that she sits on the right (not left) edge of the frame. A 7 from me though.', '2013-04-07 09:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015140, 1061368, 100393, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and moody. I think your treatment is highly effective. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Imaginative and moody. I think your treatment is highly effective. I like this a lot.', '2013-04-07 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015146, 1061342, 100393, '<td valign="top">Looks like Monica. Great light, wonderful soft glow. That line between leg and arm directing the eye to the face is a great device. The slight magenta hue of the shadows is a little distracting but I like this a lot.</td>', 'Looks like Monica. Great light, wonderful soft glow. That line between leg and arm directing the eye to the face is a great device. The slight magenta hue of the shadows is a little distracting but I like this a lot.', '2013-04-07 09:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015147, 1062108, 100393, '<td valign="top">Ha! Must be warmer there than here!<br/> <br/>Lots of joy here, care free camaraderie. I like it.</td>', 'Ha! Must be warmer there than here! Lots of joy here, care free camaraderie. I like it.', '2013-04-07 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015149, 1062139, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great dynamism and imaginatively lit. A 7 from me but I can''t help thinking a monochrome presentation might have been a little stronger.</td>', 'Great dynamism and imaginatively lit. A 7 from me but I can''t help thinking a monochrome presentation might have been a little stronger.', '2013-04-07 09:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015152, 1062148, 100393, '<td valign="top">Clever and compelling. Really interesting image.</td>', 'Clever and compelling. Really interesting image.', '2013-04-07 09:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015157, 1062059, 100393, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh! A bit of a shoehorn but superbly rendered. Some might even say this is ''the dog''s bollocks''!</td>', 'Made me laugh! A bit of a shoehorn but superbly rendered. Some might even say this is ''the dog''s bollocks''!', '2013-04-07 09:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015160, 1062156, 100393, '<td valign="top">Dark and mysterious. The shadow or band around the ankle is confounding. Excellent close crop.</td>', 'Dark and mysterious. The shadow or band around the ankle is confounding. Excellent close crop.', '2013-04-07 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015161, 1062057, 100393, '<td valign="top">The tattoo adds much interest here. I could do without the cigarette but I can see how the smoke continues your composition.</td>', 'The tattoo adds much interest here. I could do without the cigarette but I can see how the smoke continues your composition.', '2013-04-07 09:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015162, 1062100, 100393, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and creative. What a great shape. I like this.</td>', 'Imaginative and creative. What a great shape. I like this.', '2013-04-07 09:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015174, 1061573, 100393, '<td valign="top">What an even tan! And sensible boots!<br/> <br/>The smoothness of the skin offers a good juxtaposition to the textured foliage but although I''ve given a decent score of 7, I think this could be improved; getting a model in the landscape like this is such an opportunity but perhaps anonymity was important. The close crop to the head does hurt your composition a little.</td>', 'What an even tan! And sensible boots! The smoothness of the skin offers a good juxtaposition to the textured foliage but although I''ve given a decent score of 7, I think this could be improved; getting a model in the landscape like this is such an opportunity but perhaps anonymity was important. The close crop to the head does hurt your composition a little.', '2013-04-07 09:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015181, 1061799, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think this could''ve been OK but the white vignette is a bit of a killer.</td>', 'I think this could''ve been OK but the white vignette is a bit of a killer.', '2013-04-07 09:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
