(7015201, 1061768, 100393, '<td valign="top">There is a really good shot to be had here but I don''t think you''ve optimised your viewpoint. I really like the blur you''ve created in the hair and face but the view out of the window distracts.</td>', 'There is a really good shot to be had here but I don''t think you''ve optimised your viewpoint. I really like the blur you''ve created in the hair and face but the view out of the window distracts.', '2013-04-07 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
