(7015203, 1062111, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a strong gallery shot - I like it for that. Broadly it hits the nude theme (of course) and it is well-constructed but I think it does side-step the genre.</td>', 'This is a strong gallery shot - I like it for that. Broadly it hits the nude theme (of course) and it is well-constructed but I think it does side-step the genre.', '2013-04-07 09:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
