(7015975, 1062107, 100393, '<td valign="top">For me? Probably not. It''s a fair response to the challenge but the selective desaturation and the white vignette do your charming subject no favours. Having said that, the detail you have captured of the chimp is quite marvellous.</td>', 'For me? Probably not. It''s a fair response to the challenge but the selective desaturation and the white vignette do your charming subject no favours. Having said that, the detail you have captured of the chimp is quite marvellous.', '2013-04-08 03:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7015979, 1062202, 100393, '<td valign="top">Full-on nude shot! The lighting is pretty harsh though, I think a softer presentation (in terms of lighting) would have been better. The eye contact is marred by the head-dress and it looks strangely photoshopped into place (probably due to a shadow-based adjustment) - just trying to get my head around how it stands out so much. You''ve nailed the focus on the eyes though and the deep black background really isolates your subject.</td>', 'Full-on nude shot! The lighting is pretty harsh though, I think a softer presentation (in terms of lighting) would have been better. The eye contact is marred by the head-dress and it looks strangely photoshopped into place (probably due to a shadow-based adjustment) - just trying to get my head around how it stands out so much. You''ve nailed the focus on the eyes though and the deep black background really isolates your subject.', '2013-04-08 03:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
