(7017629, 1062020, 70128, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Purple_Girl:</b></div><hr/><i> This could be viewed as a comment on social acceptance norms and the perception of beauty, i.e. the man is walking away from the statue of the very rotund lady, which reflects a lot of the feeling amongst men concerning real women in everyday life, due in part to the standards of beauty put upon us by media. I''m actually bumping my vote up on this one since it made me ponder. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I totally agree with you. It seems like nudity (even partial) is only suitable for trim people. That tells a lot about us as a society, everywhere.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-04-10 10:22:37.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Purple_Girl: This could be viewed as a comment on social acceptance norms and the perception of beauty, i.e. the man is walking away from the statue of the very rotund lady, which reflects a lot of the feeling amongst men concerning real women in everyday life, due in part to the standards of beauty put upon us by media. I''m actually bumping my vote up on this one since it made me ponder.   I totally agree with you. It seems like nudity (even partial) is only suitable for trim people. That tells a lot about us as a society, everywhere.', '2013-04-10 11:21:57.000000', '2013-04-10 11:22:37.000000', 0),
(7017632, 1062065, 70128, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> A touch of softer lighting might have been more flattering, or perhaps a robe. best of luck! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was it really necessary to add that "or perhaps a robe" comment? Perhaps you need to realize that he is a human being like you. I agree on the lighting, though.</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: A touch of softer lighting might have been more flattering, or perhaps a robe. best of luck!   Was it really necessary to add that "or perhaps a robe" comment? Perhaps you need to realize that he is a human being like you. I agree on the lighting, though.', '2013-04-10 11:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
