(7019087, 1061240, 61961, '<td valign="top">It rarely happens that all my top picks end up as the top pics for the challenge.  In this case they are even in the same order!  Congrats on being number 1.</td>', 'It rarely happens that all my top picks end up as the top pics for the challenge.  In this case they are even in the same order!  Congrats on being number 1.', '2013-04-12 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7019093, 1061573, 61961, '<td valign="top">I guessed right away this was your photo.  Did no one else notice the hint of genitalia?  I''m not complaining, I just think it''s your thing to push the edge.  Also the photo is highly competent.  I could believe it was taken from the pages of Hustler magazine or some similar publication, while most entries run the gamut from artistic to bourgeois.</td>', 'I guessed right away this was your photo.  Did no one else notice the hint of genitalia?  I''m not complaining, I just think it''s your thing to push the edge.  Also the photo is highly competent.  I could believe it was taken from the pages of Hustler magazine or some similar publication, while most entries run the gamut from artistic to bourgeois.', '2013-04-12 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
