(7020485, 1062057, 159986, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the very kind comments.<br/>To answer some of the questions. She does not wear glasses, its only some hair that got in the way. Only noticed that on your comment.  :-)<br/>I drew the tattoo on my wife''s back with a fine tip pen. Took about 2 hours. The only editing was the added smoke and sharpening.<br/>Tattoo was romoved after the photo shoot. (PS: she does not smoke, the smoke came from an incense stick)</td>', 'Thank you all for the very kind comments.To answer some of the questions. She does not wear glasses, its only some hair that got in the way. Only noticed that on your comment.  :-)I drew the tattoo on my wife''s back with a fine tip pen. Took about 2 hours. The only editing was the added smoke and sharpening.Tattoo was romoved after the photo shoot. (PS: she does not smoke, the smoke came from an incense stick)', '2013-04-15 03:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
